{"id":"820f390915f7f2ba","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-polynomial-monotonicity.md","title":"df-polynomial-monotonicity","display":"df-polynomial-monotonicity","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","type":"definition","label":"56-df-polynomial-monotonicity","aliases":["56-df-polynomial-monotonicity"],"display":"df-polynomial-monotonicity","depends_on":[],"source_section":"6.2.9–6.2.10","source_pages":"188–189","source_ocr_blocks":[209,210],"source_statement_status":"checked-against-local-djvu-ocr","source_proof_status":"not-applicable"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-polynomial-monotonicity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-polynomial-monotonicity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-polynomial-monotonicity"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"6.2.9–6.2.10"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"188–189"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>209</span><span>210</span></div>"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked-against-local-djvu-ocr"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-applicable"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_2=\\{a\\in\\mathbb N\\mid a\\ge2\\}\">\\(A_2=\\{a\\in\\mathbb N\\mid a\\ge2\\}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:A_2^n\\to\\mathbb Z\">\\(p:A_2^n\\to\\mathbb Z\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\">\\([n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\)</span>。本节点给出用于多项式解释的值域条件和逐参数严格单调条件；定义本身也适用于任意这样的函数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{PolyClosed}_n(p)&amp;\\iff\\forall\\vec a\\in A_2^n\\;p(\\vec a)\\in A_2,\\\\\n\\mathrm{StrictPolyMono}_n(p)&amp;\\iff\n\\forall\\vec a,\\vec b\\in A_2^n\\;\\forall i\\in[n]\\;\\bigl(\na_i&gt;b_i\\land\\forall j\\in[n]\\setminus\\{i\\}\\;a_j=b_j\n\\Rightarrow p(\\vec a)&gt;p(\\vec b)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{PolyClosed}_n(p)&amp;\\iff\\forall\\vec a\\in A_2^n\\;p(\\vec a)\\in A_2,\\\\\n\\mathrm{StrictPolyMono}_n(p)&amp;\\iff\n\\forall\\vec a,\\vec b\\in A_2^n\\;\\forall i\\in[n]\\;\\bigl(\na_i&gt;b_i\\land\\forall j\\in[n]\\setminus\\{i\\}\\;a_j=b_j\n\\Rightarrow p(\\vec a)&gt;p(\\vec b)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Definition 6.2.9 的多项式解释要求值域封闭且每个参数严格单调。常元 n=0 时严格单调性为空条件，但仍须输出至少 2。使用 A₂ 避开 0 与 1，使乘法在两参数均严格单调，且乘积严格大于各因子。不能将“系数非负”单独当成每个参数严格单调的充分条件。</p>\n<p>来源：Terese, <em>Term Rewriting Systems</em>, Cambridge University Press, 2003；6.2.9–6.2.10，印刷页 188–189。<code>source_ocr_blocks</code> 是本地 DjVu 文本提取块序号，不是已确认的物理扫描页号。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A_2=\\{a\\in\\mathbb N\\mid a\\ge2\\}","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"p:A_2^n\\to\\mathbb Z","display":false},{"tex":"[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{PolyClosed}_n(p)&\\iff\\forall\\vec a\\in A_2^n\\;p(\\vec a)\\in A_2,\\\\\n\\mathrm{StrictPolyMono}_n(p)&\\iff\n\\forall\\vec a,\\vec b\\in A_2^n\\;\\forall i\\in[n]\\;\\bigl(\na_i>b_i\\land\\forall j\\in[n]\\setminus\\{i\\}\\;a_j=b_j\n\\Rightarrow p(\\vec a)>p(\\vec b)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1575,"backlinks":[{"id":"1fcf344733aab173","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-226","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-polynomial-monotonicity.md]]"}],"outgoing":[]}